content-lg.I believe in God,\nthe Father Almighty,\:
Nzikiriza mu Katonda,
Kitaawe Omuyinza w’ebintu byonna,
Omukama owatonda eggulu n’ensi,
era ne mu Yesu Kristo, omwana we omu yekka, Mukama waffe,
eyazaalibwa olw’amaanyi g’Omwoyo Omutukuvu,
eyazaalibwa ku Maria Omukyala atalina musajja,
yabonyaabonyezebwa mu mikono gya Pontiyo Piraato,
yafa era n’aziikibwa;
yagenda mu bafu;
ku lunaku olwokusatu yazukira mu bafu;
yagenda mu ggulu,
era atuula ku mukono ogwa ddyo ogwa Katonda Kitaawe Omuyinza w’ebintu byonna;
okuva eyo ajja kujja okusalira abalamu n’abafu omusango.

content-rny.I believe in God,\nthe Father Almighty,\:
Ninyikiriza omuri Ruhanga,
Isheboona ow'amaani goona,
Omutonzi w'eiguru n'ensi,
kandi na Yesu Kristo, Omwana we wenka, Mukama waitu,
owaateekateekirwe omu maani g'Omwoyo Orikwera,
akazaarwa Omukazi Mariamu,
yabonabona ahansi ya Pontius Pilate,
yakomererwa aha musaraba, yafa kandi yaaziikwa;
akashuuma omu bafu;
aha eizooba rya kashatu akagaruka yaazooka kuruga omu bafu;
akatemba omu iguru,
kandi ashutami aha mukono gwa buryo gwa Ruhanga Isheboona ow'amaani goona;
kuruga aho naija kwija kucwera abahuriire hamwe n'abafiire.
